  "abstract": "{\"business_domain\":[\"巨量营销-转化资产与事件管理\"],\"business_line\":[\"巨量营销\"],\"capability_summary\":\"此接口用于在事件管理资产下更新监测链接组，适用于需要对监测链接组信息进行修改的场景。关键配合接口有【获取Access token】和【附录-返回码】。\",\"id\":\"ad.event_manager_track_url.update\",\"interface_path\":\"/open_api/2/event_manager/track_url/update/\",\"method\":\"POST\",\"official_url\":\"https://open.oceanengine.com/skiff/api/doc/client/markdown/get/?language=CHINESE\\u0026doc_id=1727899035395079\",\"related_docs\":[{\"id\":\"ad.get_access_token\",\"path\":\"https://open.oceanengine.com/labels/7/docs/1696710505596940\",\"reason\":\"需要先获取授权access_token才能调用此接口\",\"relation\":\"前置接口\",\"title\":\"获取Access token\"},{\"id\":\"ad.return_code\",\"path\":\"https://open.oceanengine.com/labels/7/docs/1696710760866831\",\"reason\":\"用于查看接口返回码和返回信息的详细说明\",\"relation\":\"配合接口\",\"title\":\"附录-返回码\"}],\"risk_level\":\"medium\",\"schema_url\":\"https://open.oceanengine.com/skiff/api/doc/client/schema/markdown/get/?doc_id=1727899035395079\",\"title\":\"事件资产下更新监测链接组\"}",
  "content": "<div class=\"qz-editor-engine am-engine\" data-element=\"root\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-KF1I8oQc\">此接口用于在事件管理资产下创建监测链接组</p><blockquote data-id=\"b603af74-jwxLtPST\" style=\"margin-top: 5px; margin-bottom: 5px; padding-left: 1em; margin-left: 0px; border-left: 3px solid rgb(238, 238, 238); opacity: 0.6;\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-KebxxNbR\">事件资产与监测链接的对应关系： 非应用资产只可建一个监测链接组，应用资产下可以有N个下载链接，每个下载链接可以建N个监测链接组 <img data-auto=\"true\" data-type=\"inline\" src=\"https://p6-business-sign.byteadimg.com/tos-cn-i-yvqzo4lhg5/0049f6f1c7924e59bb4dad24f94f63f5~noop.image?x-expires=1988939425&amp;x-signature=7uV1F%2B6XV4m22KnKHPNtguB18oo%3D\" style=\"width: 2000px; visibility: visible; height: auto;\"/></p></blockquote>\n<div class=\"qz-api-metadata\" data-type=\"apimetadata\" data-value=\"data:%7B%22interfaceId%22%3A%201774275242509312%2C%20%22docLibId%22%3A%201743864733602830%7D\">\n \n</div>\n<h3 data-id=\"h6f20189-GJJekPCz\" id=\"link-0\">请求地址</h3><p data-id=\"p838747a-ov18FZtD\"><a href=\"https://ad.oceanengine.com/open_api/2/event_manager/track_url/update/\" style=\"font-size: inherit; padding: 0px 2px; line-height: inherit; overflow-wrap: break-word; text-indent: 0px;\" target=\"blank\"><span style=\"color: #333333;\">https://ad.oceanengine.com/open_api/2/event_manager/track_url/update/</span></a><a href=\"https://open.oceanengine.com/tools/visual_debug.html?docId=1727899035395079\" style=\"font-size: 12px;color: #fff; display: inline-block; padding: 2px 8px;border-radius: 4px;background: #2a55e5;margin-left: 8px; color: #fff !important;\" target=\"_blank\">可视化调试</a><a href=\"https://open.oceanengine.com/labels/7/docs/1773083358100557\" style=\"font-size: 12px;color: #fff; display: inline-block; padding: 2px 8px;border-radius: 4px;background: #2a55e5;margin-left: 8px; color: #fff !important;\" target=\"_blank\">SDK下载</a><a href=\"https://open.oceanengine.com/labels/7/docs/1847394521222599\" style=\"font-size: 12px;color: #fff; display: inline-block; padding: 2px 8px;bo